  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This File Geodatabase is a historical copy of foundational data layers for the city of Baltimore, Maryland in 2026. It contains 20 feature classes: Address_Point, Baltimore_Gateways, Bus_stops, City_Line, Council_District, MARC_Train, Neighborhood_NSA, Primary_SnowZones, Real_Property, Secondary_Snowzones, Street_Centerline, Transportation_Sectors, Zoning, bridge, bus_route, lightrail, lightrail_station, subway, subway_station, zipcar_location. All layers use EPSG:2248 NAD83 / Maryland (ftUS), except the City_Line, which is in EPSG:3857 WGS 84 / Pseudo-Mercator. The layers range in temporal coverage from 2020 through 2026."
  ],
